# Development preview harness — static fixture data that must never be tracked
# or shipped. The harness itself has been removed; these entries also stop a
# future one from being committed by accident. `vite.config.ts` independently
# fails any build that pulls preview markers into the bundle.
.preview/
.preview-dist/
